use-da-used: USE_DA_USED = YES

Classification: profile setting.

Records DA-protected use in NV (daUsed) and counts an authorization failure
after a non-orderly shutdown only if one occurred, as tpm-rs and mstpm20 do
(Part 1, "Non-orderly Shutdown").

diff --git a/src/TpmBuildSwitches.h b/src/TpmBuildSwitches.h
--- a/src/TpmBuildSwitches.h
+++ b/src/TpmBuildSwitches.h
@@ -241,7 +241,10 @@
 
 // Definition to allow alternate behavior for non-orderly startup. If there is a
 // chance that the TPM could not update 'failedTries'
-#define USE_DA_USED                 NO
+// tpm-rs differential testing: record DA-protected use in NV (daUsed) and
+// count a failure after a non-orderly shutdown only if one occurred, as
+// tpm-rs and mstpm20 do (Part 1, "Non-orderly Shutdown").
+#define USE_DA_USED                 YES
 
 // This switch is used to enable the self-test capability in AlgorithmTests.c
 #define ENABLE_SELF_TESTS                   YES
